S|               INT. BOARD ROOM. DAY.                                                
N,I|               A NAKED MAN lies face up, unconscious on a large oak table.          
N|               The room around him is comfortable but sterile. There are no         
N|               windows and the only light buzzes from the florescent panels         
N|               above. Pastel prints line the beige walls.                           
O|
N,I|               This is MARK, mid 30’s. He’s tall and thin, his hair neatly          
N,I|               combed, his breath slow but even.                                    
O|
N|               Suddenly, Mark’s eyes shoot open and he bolts to a sitting           
N|               position. He gasps as his eyes dart around the room.                 
O|
N|               For a very long moment, all is quiet.                                
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         Hello?                                                     
O|
N|               He tries to get to his knees but they give way and he tumbles        
N|               off the table.                                                       
O|
N|               Shakily, he moves toward the door. He tries to open it, but          
N|               it’s locked solidly.                                                 
O|
N|               He turns back to the room.                                           
O|
C,E|                                   MARK (CONT’D)                                    
U|                         Where the hell am I!?                                      
N|               At the far end of the table is mounted a small, black                
N,I|               Intercom. It clicks on, emitting a MAN’S VOICE.                      
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         Who are you?                                               
O|
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         What?                                                      
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         Who are you?                                               
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         I- Who the hell are you?                                   
O|
N|               Brief pause.                                                         
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         I’m sorry, sir. I got ahead of                             
U|                         myself.                                                    
O|
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         What is this place? Open the damn                          
U|                         door!                                                      
O|
O|
O|                                                                      2.            
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
