U|                         quick survey?                                              
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         What?                                                      
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         Six questions. I feel confident it                         
U|                         will benefit us both.                                      
O|
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         Wha- No! Let me the hell out of                            
U|                         this room!                                                 
