U|                         Okay, thank you for your time.                             
O|
N|               It clicks off.                                                       
O|
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         Hey! Hey!                                                  
O|
N|               Mark scours the room, but can find no other way out.                 
O|
N|               He returns to the door, twisting hard on the knob. He kicks          
N|               at it, but his weak legs give out and once again he falls to         
N|               the floor.                                                           
C,E|                                   MARK (CONT’D)                                    
U|                         Damnit!                                                    
O|
N|               He lays on the carpet, breathing heavily.                            
O|
C,E|                                   MARK (CONT’D)                                    
U|                         Hey! You there?                                            
O|
N|               The intercom clicks on.                                              
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         I’m here.                                                  
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         Six questions?                                             
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         Yes, sir.                                                  
O|
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         What do I get at the end?                                  
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         Depends on your answers.                                   
O|
O|
O|                                                                      3.            
O|
N|               Mark sighs.                                                          
C|                                   MARK                                             
U|                         Well, since you seem to have caught                        
U|                         me between things-                                         
O|
C,E|                                   MAN’S VOICE                                      
U|                         Who are you?                                               
O|
