S|               INT. DARKENED HALL. DAY.                                             
O|
N|               Mark creeps cautiously down a thin, unlit hall.                      
O|
N|               The hall is full of sharp twists, preventing Mark from seeing        
N|               more than a few feet ahead.                                          
O|
N|               Ahead is a bend, around which Mark can see light.                    
O|
S|               INT. ORIENTATION CHAMBER. DAY.                                       
N|               Mark steps out into a small, dimly lit room.                         
O|
N,I|               In the center of the room is a table, at which sit a man and         
N,I|               a woman.                                                             
O|
N,I|               FRANK MILCHICK, 35, is a big and brawny, despite the dainty          
